{"id":"vod_md_3713","vodId":"3713","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"灵能百分百","name_cn":"灵能百分百","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230830-1/4fb0ee291301c551020e96df2cfe0d55.jpg"},"summary":"眼睛只看到金钱的江湖骗子灵幻新隆衣冠楚楚，道貌岸然，巧舌如簧，他以灵能力者的身份替委托者解决各种诡异事件，其实半点灵力没有。每当遇见真正的恶灵而又无法解决时，灵幻便会叫来他的弟子——真正拥有超强令能力的中学生影山茂夫（绰号“龙套”）。龙套君无论在学校还是家中都毫无存在感，呆呆傻傻的他隐藏着常人甚至灵能力者都难以想象的可怕力量。每当他的灵能力值达到100%时，他的对手必将遭遇有生以来最可怕的回忆。在与灵幻老师修行的过程中，龙套君遇到了各式各样的敌人，灵魂深处的自我也渐渐苏醒……本片根据漫画家ONE的同名原作改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-30 08:04:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/wwoeH0eg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/aBS8nGLB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/8DyBSpSk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/gZYNR60o/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/LSxDwtFT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/zk2Es6V8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/RZ2iCpKu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/skWiCrRr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/nMAAbvWm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/4QEASG54/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/E63lTmXO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/2vJKtlGE/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:44:48.998Z"}